# Agent graph engineering

When changing multi-agent workflows or Windows+WSL hosting:

1. Treat `docs/*-graph.yaml` as the authoritative node/edge contract.
2. Assign models per skill policy: `grok-4.7-medium` (orchestrate/review), `composer-2.5` (implement), `claude-haiku-5-5-high` (research/test). Never use `*-fast` models.
3. Preserve DmuxAI adapter sandbox boundaries documented in `docs/specs/DMUXAI-BASELINE.md`.
4. Edge context must be explicit and bounded; do not assume cross-pane shared state until a transport exists.
